2 CONT Microfilm: roll 716; Vol. 30, Sheet 18, E.D. 67, Saline Co., MO
2 CONT Listed as Leonard Wilson, age 34.   Born in Missouri, father born in Vi
2 CONC rginia, mother born in Kentucky.  Occupation, postmaster.  Household co
2 CONC nsisted of Leonard, Mary, and Lennie [Leonie] Wilson; and Minnie Sandid
2 CONC ge, listed as a niece [I believe her to be the daughter of Mary's broth
2 CONC er, Micajah C. Sandidge].
2 CONT
