2 CONC issouri.  Had measles.  Living with her parents.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1900 census
2 CONT Listed as Leonie Leighton, widow.  No children.  Age 27, born May 1873.  B
2 CONC orn in Missouri, both parents born in Missouri.  Occupation, school tea
2 CONC cher.  Living with her parents.
