2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT The name is spelled Donly in the Parks manuscript, Hotchkiss manuscript
2 CONC , and Cormode info; Donnelly in the Wanamaker manuscript, WFT 22 # 1690
2 CONC , and WFT 137 # 299; and Donley in the Adair Wilson family record and t
2 CONC he DAR database on Ancestry.com.  Bob Reeves lists Donly, Donley, and D
2 CONC onnelly in various places.  The DAR seems like the most authoritative o
2 CONC f these, so I'm going with Donley.  Perhaps more importantly, the spell
2 CONC ing Donley is well established for Stockton Donley and Donley County, T
2 CONC X.
