2 CONC he Revolutionary War.  This is confirmed by a statement from 1781 or 17
2 CONC 82 included in Chalkley's Chronicles (Vol. 1, pp. 525-26) with William D
2 CONC avis as a signatory (also Jas. Davis and Charles Donely).  Note that Wi
2 CONC lliam would have been only 15 or 16 years old at the time.
