1 NOTE Several sources show his first name as Edward, but this appears to be o
2 CONC ne of the cases of using the mother’s maiden name as a son’s first name
2 CONC .  James Hotchkiss gives his death date as 3 Nov 1950, but the Californ
2 CONC ia Death Index and U.S. Headstone Applications for Military Veterans, b
2 CONC oth on Ancestry.com, show November 8.  The Headstone Application shows t
