2 CONT BROWN -- In this city, February 10, 1913, Austin H., dearly beloved hus
2 CONC band of Katherine Wilson Brown, and loving father of Wilson J. Brown an
2 CONC d Austin Adair Brown, a native of Indiana, aged 51 years 9 months and 1
2 CONC 6 days.  (Colorado and Montana papers please copy.)
2 CONT
2 CONT Funeral services to be held under the auspices of Durant Lodge No. 286, M
2 CONC asonic, Berkeley, Bancroft way and Shattuck avenue, Thursday, February 1
2 CONC 3, at 2 o'clock p. m.  Interment Mountain View cemetery.  Friends and a
2 CONC cquaintances respectfully invited to attend.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Note, however, that FindAGrave.com, in the listing for Austin Howard Br
2 CONC own, says:
2 CONT
