2 CONC ame and birth & death dates are found in Crown Hill Cem., Indianapolis, I
2 CONC N. Likely he died in CA and his body was taken to Crown Hill for burial
2 CONC .  [Note, however, that FindAGrave had incorrect death info for him: 10 M
2 CONC ar 1913 in Sacramento, CA.]
