1 NOTE WFT 22 Tree  1690 has her name as Nancy Jane Phillips.  Bob Reeves says M
2 CONC ary or Nancy Jane Phillips.
2 CONT
2 CONT The Phillips Family Group Sheet says that she and all of her siblings w
2 CONC ere born in Paris, KY.  However, the McReynolds Family Biographical Ske
2 CONC tch (http://digilib.kyvl.org/dynaweb/oak/knvead/knvmfaead/mss56/@Generi
2 CONC c__B ookTextView/141; this link no longer works) said that the Phillips f
2 CONC amily moved to Todd County, about two miles from Elkton, in 1806.  It s
2 CONC aid that Mary Jane lived in Elkton all her life.  However, note that El
2 CONC kton and Todd County did not exist until 1820.  Todd County was formed f
2 CONC rom Christian and Logan Counties, and I'm not sure which one the Philli
2 CONC ps family was in; the Elkton area was near the dividing line between th
2 CONC e two.  I am putting Christian County for her birth place, but I am not s
2 CONC ure of that.
