1 NOTE Information from Robert Davis said that Burris Kincaid Davis married Mi
2 CONC ss May in Hamilton, White Pine Co., NV.  However, information from Step
2 CONC hen Landuyt and from a WorldConnect tree at http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry
2 CONC .com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=:2182804&id=I111709552 is that Burris Ki
2 CONC ncaid Davis married Mary Amelia Haight.  I think "Miss May" should have b
2 CONC een "Miss Mary".
2 CONT
2 CONT Stephen Landuyt says she was born about 1846.  Some sources say she was b
2 CONC orn in October 1847, but the censuses from her childhood (8 years old i
2 CONC n the 1855 New York state census, 14 years old in the 1860 U.S. census) a
2 CONC re more consistent with an earlier birth than that.  Note that birth in O
2 CONC ctober 1847 would mean she was only 15 when she married B.K. Davis.
2 CONT
2 CONT According to Stephen Landuyt, she remarried in 1883 to a miner named St
2 CONC ephen E. Starrett.  They lived in Hamilton, NV, until 1888, when they m
2 CONC oved to San Francisco.
