2 CONC ive with her nephew, Burris Kincaid Landuyt, until her death at age 85 o
2 CONC n 3 Dec. 1972.  Auntie is buried with Unk and her mother, Sarah, in DeS
2 CONC oto, Jefferson County, MO.
