2 CONC iver, and my Dad recalls visiting the creamery as a boy, where he met o
2 CONC ther members of the family without knowing back then how they were rela
2 CONC ted.  It wasn't until I started researching our family history some 80 y
2 CONC ears later that I was able to put the pieces together and tell my Dad h
2 CONC ow the folks that he had met at the creamery as a boy, were related.
2 CONT
