1 NOTE She is listed as Martha in the George Chrisman House web page and the C
2 CONC ain-Boyd Tree, and Martha G. in the article from Hardesty's Encyclopedi
2 CONC a that is reproduced in the notes for brother George.  The George Chris
2 CONC man House web page and the Cain-Boyd Tree both say she died in 1873.  T
2 CONC here is a listing that purports to be for her on Find A Grave, with nam
2 CONC e Margaret B "Mattie" Chrisman, and death on 18 Apr 1872.  This is stra
2 CONC nge since Mattie is usually a nickname for Martha, not Margaret.  That, p
2 CONC lus the difference in middle initial and in the death year, makes me wo
2 CONC nder if it's the right person.  On the other hand, the entry is from a c
2 CONC emetery where many family members are buried and the Find A Grave entry d
2 CONC oes have the right birth date.  The question is whether that birth date i
2 CONC s actually from the cemetery or whether a Find A Grave contributor look
2 CONC ed it up elsewhere.  I guess for now I will use the information from Fi
2 CONC nd A Grave, but I am suspicious of it.
