2 CONT Florence, Feb. 4--(Special)--Mrs. Kate T. S. Gregg, 76, died in a local h
2 CONC ospital early today after an illness of about four weeks.  Mrs. Gregg, w
2 CONC ell known and revered throughout this section, was the widow of B. G. G
2 CONC regg.
