2 CONC e of her daughter, Mrs. Frank H. Barnwell.  The Rev. Eben Taylor, pasto
2 CONC r of the Central Methodist church here, will conduct the services, assi
2 CONC sted by the Rev. W. S. Poyner.
2 CONT
