2 CONC .  She was a daughter of the late Judge John Green Smith.
2 CONT
2 CONT She is survived by one son, B. G. Gregg, Jr., and one daughter, Mrs. Fr
2 CONC ank H. Barnwell, both of Florence; a sister, Mrs. Fannie S. Effinger of N
2 CONC ew York City, and a brother, Herbert Smith of Staunton, Va.
