2 CONC nd Dora Elizabeth Willis Davis Breshears.  He was a mechanic and worked f
2 CONC or Davis Lawn Equipment, retiring in 1990.  He was also a retired farme
2 CONC r.  He married Veda Duncan on May 17, 1947, lived in Saline County most o
2 CONC f his life and attended Southside Assembly of God in Marshall.
2 CONT
2 CONT Survivors include his wife; a daughter, Elaine Ahrens of Blue Springs, M
2 CONC o.; two sons, Marvin L. Davis and Robert A. Davis, both of Marshall; tw
2 CONC o sisters, Gertrude Davis of Napton, Mo., and Laura Ostler of Fresno, C
2 CONC alif.; his mother of Marshall; six grandchildren; two great-grandchildr
2 CONC en; and several nieces and nephews.
