2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel Pearce Trewolla was born in England on February 6, 1795 and bapt
2 CONC ized on February 8, 1795 at St. Clement's Parish, Truro, Cornwall Count
2 CONC y, England.  He was in the state of Virginia prior to 1818 having come t
2 CONC o America with his brother, Henry, and his sister, Nancy.  He died abou
2 CONC t 1829 in Greenville County, Virginia and is buried in Greenville Count
2 CONC y, Virginia.  He married Rowena Laphand on July 14, 1765 at St. Agnes P
2 CONC arish in Cornwall County, England.
2 CONT
